<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT BOSNIA 1-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZIL BEAT BOSNIA 1-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>MANAUS, Brazil 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil beat Bosnia 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a friendly soccer international on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Ronaldo (67th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
